{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2023-05-04 12:00:00', 'title': 'GOOG, GOOGL INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD ALPHABET INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES EXCEEDING $100,000 ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM. \xa0 LOS ANGELES , MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE LAW OFFICES OF FRANK R.'}{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2023-05-04 05:45:00', 'title': 'GOOGL LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES ALPHABET INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN ALPHABET INC. ("ALPHABET" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: GOOGL) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF ALPHABET INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN FEBRUARY 4, 2020 AND JANUARY 23, 2023.'}